            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28627623?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Added a note about unsupported drag-and-drop API on touch devices.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This information is rather unintuitive. It's important that developers are made aware of this early.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">None.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">None.</p>",
