        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Firefox 155 adds support for the Wasm <a href=\"https://github.com/WebAssembly/compact-import-section/blob/main/proposals/compact-import-section/Overview.md\">compact import section proposal</a>; see <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2062344\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2062344</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR adds documentation for <code class=\"notranslate\">import</code> in general and this specific proposal, and a Fx155 rel note for it.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #45194.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5170085780\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45194\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/45194/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45194\">#45194</a></p>\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45310",
            "title": "Technical review: Document Wasm compact import sections proposal",
            "date_modified": "2026-08-26T12:25:42.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-08-25T12:46:24.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "chrisdavidmills",
                "url": "https://github.com/chrisdavidmills"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Docs updates to spec WebTransport following <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2007165\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2007165</a> and <a href=\"https://bugzil.la/2007174\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzil.la/2007174</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This essentially reviews the interfaces touched by those issues ^^^ and makes sure that they have docs, and that those docs match the spec.</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">WebTransportSendStream.sendGroup()</code> - new doc</li>\n<li>UPdates to\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>WebTransport.createWritable</li>\n<li>WebTransportDatagramDuplexStream</li>\n<li>WebTransportDatagramsWritable (and props/methods)</li>\n<li>WebTransportSendGroup</li>\n<li>WebTransportSebdStream</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Ths is related the issues</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5179621126\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45214\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/45214/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45214\">#45214</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5179622026\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45215\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/45215/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45215\">#45215</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45307",
            "title": "WebTransportSendGroup and WebTransportSendStream etc updates",
            "date_modified": "2026-08-25T08:17:59.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-08-25T08:16:14.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "hamishwillee",
                "url": "https://github.com/hamishwillee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF155 adds support for <code class=\"notranslate\">WebTransport.draining</code> in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2007160\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2007160</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds docs for the property, including reference and an update to the overview page to mention it.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs can be tracked in  <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5179620342\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45213\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/45213/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45213\">#45213</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45306",
            "title": "WebTransport.draining docs",
            "date_modified": "2026-08-25T03:20:56.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-08-25T03:18:07.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "hamishwillee",
                "url": "https://github.com/hamishwillee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF155 adds support for <code class=\"notranslate\">WebTransport.draining</code> in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2007160\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2007160</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds the release note.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs can be tracked in  <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5179620342\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45213\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/45213/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45213\">#45213</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45305",
            "title": "FF155 Relnote: WebTransport.draining",
            "date_modified": "2026-08-26T07:46:39.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-08-25T02:49:18.000Z",
